<%# The button that opens the whole picture: the three figures in the row are a
    glance, and this is where a reader goes when the glance raises a question —
    what paid for that cost, which model answered, and how much allowance the
    provider has left.

    It is a `<details>` rather than a dialog so it needs no script to open, and
    Escape closes it through the page's own handler. The panel hangs above the
    status line instead of pushing it: the line is at the bottom edge of the
    screen, and a panel below it would open off the page.

    The facts are drawn with the page, then kept current by the same
    out-of-band swap that moves the row. The allowance is not: it costs a
    request to the provider, so it is fetched once, the first time the panel is
    opened, and only when the reader actually asks. -%>
<details class="usage-sheet"
         hx-get="/s/<%= h(session_id) %>/quota<%= h(token_query) %>"
         hx-target="#usage-quota"
         hx-swap="innerHTML"
         hx-trigger="toggle[this.open]">
  <summary class="usage-toggle" title="Pemakaian dan kuota" aria-label="Pemakaian dan kuota">
    <%= usage_icon(:usage) %>
  </summary>

  <div class="usage-panel" role="group" aria-label="Pemakaian dan kuota">
    <p class="panel-title">Pemakaian</p>
    <%= View.render("_usage_facts", **facts) %>

    <p class="panel-title">Kuota</p>
    <div id="usage-quota" class="usage-quota">
      <p class="usage-note">Memeriksa kuota…</p>
    </div>

    <%# The door out of the pinned prompt. It sits behind a panel rather than in
        the row for the same reason the allowance does: it is not a reading, it
        is something a reader does once in a while, and it costs one request
        without a cache. The note says so before the press, not after. -%>
    <p class="panel-title">Prompt</p>
    <div class="usage-repin">
      <button type="button" class="btn"
              hx-post="/s/<%= h(session_id) %>/repin<%= h(token_query) %>"
              hx-target="#repin-note" hx-swap="innerHTML">Bangun ulang</button>
      <p class="usage-note" id="repin-note">Memory, skill, dan AGENTS.md yang berubah di tengah sesi baru masuk setelah compaction — atau di sini, dengan ongkos satu request tanpa cache.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</details>
